msgid ""
"``sum`` adds the items of an iterable starting from ``0``: ``1 + 2 + 3 == "
"6``."
msgstr ""
"``sum`` suma los elementos de un iterable partiendo de ``0``: ``1 + 2 + 3 =="
" 6``."

